  data: {
    LLM: '1. Deal 5 cards to each player, remainder forms talon\n2. Turn top card of talon for trump indicator\n3. Player holding 7 of trumps may exchange it for the trump indicator\n4. Play consists of series of parties (deals)\n5. Each partie: Players play cards, may declare marianna (K+Q of same suit)\n6. First marianna declared sets trump suit and scores 40 points\n7. Later mariannas score 60, 80, 100 points but may or may not change trump\n8. Winner of last trick scores extra 10 points (dix de der)\n9. Total points per partie: 130 (cards) + 10 (last trick) + possible marianna points',
    Player: '1. Deal 5 cards to each player, remainder forms talon\n2. Turn top card of talon for trump indicator\n3. Player holding 7 of trumps may exchange it for the trump indicator\n4. Play consists of series of parties (deals)\n5. Each partie: Players play cards, may declare marianna (K+Q of same suit)\n6. First marianna declared sets trump suit and scores 40 points\n7. Later mariannas score 60, 80, 100 points but may or may not change trump\n8. Winner of last trick scores extra 10 points (dix de der)\n9. Total points per partie: 130 (cards) + 10 (last trick) + possible marianna points',
    objective: 'Score card points by winning tricks containing valuable cards (brisques) and by declaring combinations (marianna). Win the partie by reaching the target score first. A complete game consists of the best of three manches.',
    gameplay: '1. Deal 5 cards to each player, remainder forms talon\n2. Turn top card of talon for trump indicator\n3. Player holding 7 of trumps may exchange it for the trump indicator\n4. Play consists of series of parties (deals)\n5. Each partie: Players play cards, may declare marianna (K+Q of same suit)\n6. First marianna declared sets trump suit and scores 40 points\n7. Later mariannas score 60, 80, 100 points but may or may not change trump\n8. Winner of last trick scores extra 10 points (dix de der)\n9. Total points per partie: 130 (cards) + 10 (last trick) + possible marianna points',
